# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep local state out of
# the image. `data/` in particular holds uploaded files, per-source SQLite
# databases and the AutoML model signing key — baking any of that into a shared
# image would leak one installation's data into every other one.
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
data/
*.db
*.sqlite3
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
